----                             19114  	
----                             19115  ; ======================================================
----                             19116  ; In the M100 this address is not called. It is used 
----                             19117  ; however in the T102 rom.
----                             19118  ; TODO: compare logic to that of the M100, it is
----                             19119  ; a different routine all together.
